   RESERVED FONT NAME — why one font here is renamed
            IBM Plex Mono carries the Reserved Font Name "Plex". Subsetting a
            font counts as modifying it under OFL 1.1 clause 3, and a modified
            version may not use the reserved name. The subset here is therefore
            renamed "Aninda Mono". The unmodified family stays as the next
            fallback in the stack, so anyone who already has IBM Plex Mono gets
            the original. Literata and Noto Serif Bengali carry no reserved name
            and keep theirs.

